Expanded story:
On a sunny morning in the small apartment, Amy stirred eggs for Will and Amber while humming softly over the sizzling pan. A sudden groan rattled the kitchen door; a zombie lunged through it, its eyes glazed on her kids. She grabbed Will by the arm and pulled him toward the back bedroom closet, then scooped up Amber and shoved her into the same safe spot. Turning back to the kitchen, breathing hard, she stepped over the breakfast table and pushed open the cabinet door. Under the sink she found a hidden compartment; inside lay a pistol in its holster and a katana with gleaming blade. With weapons ready, Amy faced each zombie that shuffled from the living room—one after another—and sliced or shot them until more swarmed her. When the last of the undead fell to dust, she breathed out slowly. She opened the closet door and carried Will and Amber back into the kitchen, bringing them safely home.
